STYLE='''PIXEL-ART fighting-game atlas of ONE complete Sproto per cell. Preserve exact THREE yellow eyes, blue head, red nose and lips, yellow chest/red circle, body proportions and two arms/two low-rooted legs. His attacks are powerful VOCAL SHOUTS. Pose the torso inhaling/leaning and the broad RED mouth opening to yell; no physical kicking or punching as the strike. Mouth can show a dark interior, but facial identity and all THREE eyes stay intact. Hands brace near chest or balance the body. No printed words, bubbles, wave shapes or particles: engine draws the flying word RETAIN. Crisp pixels, dark outlines, compact shading, magenta #ff00ff background, complete silhouette and generous cell margins.'''
CORE='''Exactly 32 complete figures in FOUR columns and EIGHT rows; exactly four per row.
Row 1: relaxed guard; breathing guard; near guarded step; passing step.
Row 2: far guarded step; far passing step; forward dash; jump anticipation.
Row 3: rising jump; falling jump; crouched landing; vocal inhale anticipation.
Row 4: forceful short shout to RIGHT with mouth wide; exhale recovery; deep low inhale; upward projected shout.
Row 5: deep inhale chest coil; mouth opens halfway; full powerful horizontal SCREAM to RIGHT with feet planted; shout recoil/retract.
Row 6: crouched low shout to RIGHT; crouch recover; airborne inhale knees tucked; airborne full SCREAM to RIGHT, no kick.
Row 7: hit recoil; high braced guard; reach to catch; close hold, no opponent.
Row 8: throw follow-through; mouth inhale to charge ranged scream; mouth fully open projecting RETAIN scream, no word drawn; emphatic full-power scream special stance.'''
EVENTS='''Exactly 32 complete figures in FOUR columns and EIGHT rows; exactly four per row.
Row 1 INTRO: calm guard; determined look; inhale confidently; settle guard.
Row 2 SPECIAL A: deep chest inhale; mouth chambers; powerful SCREAM to RIGHT; breath recoil.
Row 3 SPECIAL B: second dynamic SCREAM with torso drive; breath retract; full finishing SCREAM to RIGHT; recover guard.
Row 4 CAST: inhale; red lips prepare to open; wide-mouth forward SCREAM release; exhale to guard. No text or projectile drawn.
Row 5 RECOIL: chest hit flinch; torso leans back; knees absorb; regain guard.
Row 6 DEFEAT: stagger; knees buckle; drop; roll onto side.
Row 7 FLOOR REST: fully side-lying, head LEFT feet RIGHT; settle; shoulder relaxes; still lying.
Row 8 FINAL REST: same complete side-lying body; relaxed eyes; still lying; final rest. Preserve three eyes and red lips. Never stand in final eight poses.'''
